@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-02  Invite and activate privileged staff
' Requirements: ACC-09 ACC-10 PERM-01 NOTICE-02
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as A
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Invited staff member" as I
A -> S: Invite intended email as Administrator or Program Head
S --> A: Record invitation and report its status
S --> I: Deliver invitation to intended address
I -> S: Accept invitation and verify intended email
alt Invalid or expired invitation, or wrong recipient
  S --> I: Do not activate access; explain invitation problem
else Valid invitation and verified intended recipient
  I -> S: Provide full name and create own password
  S --> I: Activate the single invited role
end
note over S
Optional employee number.
Initial Administrator is school-designated.
Invitation expiry value belongs in TRD.md.
Public registration cannot choose these roles.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-02 | Product behavior
@enduml
